  (text "5x42 red LED display: six 757AS 5x7 matrices, MBI5024 constant-current sinks" (at 20.32 20.32 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid fd832a80-1692-57d4-82d5-1973f9ee4c9e)
  )
  (text "Data chain: SDI -> U4 (rows) -> U3 -> U2 -> U1 -> SDO. Shift 64 bits per row: U1 bits first, U4 bits last, then pulse LE." (at 20.32 26.67 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 0063759d-e8f0-5bd0-bdfe-b5e60a2726d2)
  )
  (text "Column current: I = 1.24 V / R-EXT x 15. 1.87k gives about 10 mA. U4 only pulls the SI2301 gates low, so 6.2k (about 3 mA) is plenty." (at 20.32 30.48 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid d83f2825-e812-56ee-941d-e75aadec02a1)
  )
  (text "One row on at a time: U4 output low turns its SI2301 on (gate pulled up to VBAT by 4.7k). Blank with OE high while switching rows." (at 20.32 180.34 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid bf45d342-8d4e-5f87-8e53-304e585dcf20)
  )
  (text "757AS rotated 90 deg clockwise on the board: R1-R5 are anode rows, C1-C7 cathode columns. Column n of matrix k is display column 7(k-1)+n." (at 20.32 200.66 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid a47f5e8b-1022-5f8a-a95a-f8018e964646)
  )
  (text "C1-C4: 100 nF next to each driver VDD pin. C5: 22 uF bulk at the input." (at 20.32 34.29 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 4afaaa2b-9fe5-5ec5-b188-65620af4ad6c)
  )

